    <div class='row'>
      <h2 class='case-section-heading'>Designing across formats</h2>

      <p>
        At Logina, my title was simply Designer because the role covered a wide range of work. I
        created interfaces for public touchscreen terminals, product graphics, packaging, printed
        sales materials, technical illustrations, software visuals, and animated presentations.
      </p>

      <p>
        This work reflects the technology, visual conventions, and production methods of the early
        2000s. I have included it because it shows my early professional experience translating
        technical products into visual communication across physical and digital formats.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class='row'>
      <h2 class='case-section-heading'>Touchscreen applications</h2>

      <p>
        Logina developed public information terminals and its own software for building touchscreen
        applications. I used that software to design and assemble applications for tourism and
        public-information services.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class='row'>
      <div class='case-study-grid'>
        <article class='case-study-block case-study-block--challenge'>
          <h2>Public information interfaces</h2>

          <p>
            Touchscreen interfaces needed to be understandable without instructions and usable by
            visitors with different language backgrounds. The controls therefore had to be large,
            visible, and easy to recognise on public terminals.
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>
              Designed touchscreen layouts and navigation
            </li>
            <li>
              Created large controls suitable for public terminals
            </li>
            <li>
              Organised multilingual information
            </li>
            <li>
              Built the applications using Logina’s proprietary software
            </li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <figure class='case-study-item case-study-media--explore'>
          <img
            class='thumb'
            src='{{base}}assets/images/design-logina-touchscreen-portoroz-600.webp'
            data-src='design-logina-touchscreen-portoroz-600.webp'
